# Diagnostics
```
ci.yaml:2:1 lint/nursery/useGithubWorkflowName ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! This workflow doesn't have a name.
  
    1 │ # should generate diagnostics
  > 2 │ on: push
      │ ^^^^^^^^
  > 3 │ jobs:
  > 4 │   build:
  > 5 │     runs-on: ubuntu-latest
  > 6 │     steps:
  > 7 │       - run: echo "Hello"
      │       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    8 │ 
  
  i Without a name, GitHub shows the path of the workflow file in the Actions tab and in pull request checks, which makes workflows harder to tell apart.
  
  i Add a top-level name key that describes what the workflow does.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

